# Dependencies & build output (reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/out-tsc
**/bin

# Local env files — never bake into images (config comes via env_file at runtime)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# VCS, editors, tooling
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
.claude

# Docs & scratch
**/*.md
docs
tmp
*.excalidraw

# Test / coverage output
**/test-output
**/coverage
*.log
